  "known_limitations": [
    "Licence and publishing organisation for the source are NOT established; the candidate must not be published, uploaded or served until they are (facilities/source/nhf_authorization_checklist_v1.json).",
    "NOT nationwide: Adamawa, Kebbi, Sokoto have no rows in the source; 95 of 774 LGA names are absent.",
    "type is null on every record. A null type is not a member of the declared vocabulary; the consumer must not filter it out and must never produce an empty result list because of it. Which facilities to show for which urgency is a Product decision that has not been made.",
    "emergency_capable is null on every record; there is no verified positive record, so emergency prioritisation cannot apply and ordering falls back to distance until Product/Clinical record an explicit fallback decision.",
    "The source writes latitude and longitude the wrong way round for whole states. 11141 rows were corrected under coordinate_orientation_v1 with the source values kept on the record; 1442 rows are held as ambiguous and 67 refused as invalid. Every correction is listed in reports/facilities_coordinate_audit_v1.json.",
    "The boundary instrument is GRID3's facility points, not polygons: a facility more than 25 km from any GRID3 facility, or near a state line, reads as uncertain and is held rather than decided. Where a state's latitude and longitude are numerically close, both orientations can be inside the state; those rows are held too.",
    "No record in the source was individually verified (every row is a bulk import).",
    "phone is carried in normalised form, but public-use intent for it is not established; no tel: action should be offered before Product review.",
    "524 source rows without a coordinate pair are quarantined, not emitted.",
    "Exact duplicates are collapsed by a strict rule; looser duplicates (same name and LGA at different points) remain and are counted, not merged.",
    "source_record.lga_id identifies an LGA name, not a state/LGA pair: 11 names carry one id across two states. Key LGAs by (state, city_area), never by lga_id alone.",
    "498 facility names are entirely upper case in the source and are carried as such; re-casing was not applied because it corrupts acronyms. Display casing is a consumer concern.",
    "The artifact is an order of magnitude larger than facilities 1.1; a distribution profile is an open engineering decision."
  ],
